    "preamble": "Nalam Rajasekhar, vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 7 September, 2020 Author: D.Ramesh Bench: D.Ramesh The Honourable Sri Justice D.Ramesh Criminal Petition No.3679 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioner under Section 482 Cr.P.C., to quash the proceedings in F.I.R.No.116 of 2019, dated 07.06.2019, of Rentachintala Police Station, Guntur District registered for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 273, 420, 120-B IPC and Sections 58 and 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "The learned counsel for the petitioner and the learned Public Prosecutor submit that the issue involved in the present case is squarely covered by the common order, dated 18.12.2019, passed by this Court in Crl.P.No.5421 of 2019 and batch.",
